ield/choices "05db9f38-531a-57a8-8ed6-1077065a7257"] [:db/add "4841a2ba-e729-5d5a-9b30-9d8da775c96a" :answer-field/choices "7a3a9230-e49c-5fb1-9181-6d935627f64b"] [:db/add "4841a2ba-e729-5d5a-9b30-9d8da775c96a" :answer-field/correct "05db9f38-531a-57a8-8ed6-1077065a7257"] [:db/ensure "4841a2ba-e729-5d5a-9b30-9d8da775c96a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0" :question/id #uuid "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0"] [:db/add "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\na_1=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_2=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\quad a_3=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\quad b=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nIf $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b,$ then what is $x_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}?$"] [:db/add "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1a_1+x_2a_2+x_3a_3=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x_1\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+x_2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+x_3\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} \\\\ 0 \\\\ x_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}x_{2} \\\\ - 2 x_{2} \\\\ 2 x_{2}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}3 x_{3} \\\\ - 11 x_{3} \\\\ x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} \\\\ - 2 x_{2} - 11 x_{3} \\\\ x_{1} + 2 x_{2} + x_{3}\\end{bmatrix}&=\\begin{bmatrix}14 \\\\ -48 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} &=14 \\\\ - 2 x_{2} - 11 x_{3} &=-48 \\\\ x_{1} + 2 x_{2} + x_{3} &=8\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWe will solve this system using Gaussian elimination. First, we write the augmented matrix for this system:\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & 8\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nRow-reducing the augmented matrix, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M&=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 1 & 8\\end{array}\\right] \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(-1)R_{1} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -11 & -48\\end{array}\\right] && R_{2}\\leftrightarrow R_{3} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -15 & -60\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=R_{3}+(2)R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 14 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right] && R_{3}:=\\left(- \\frac{1}{15}\\right)R_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x_{1} + x_{2} + 3 x_{3} &=14 \\\\ x_{2} - 2 x_{3} &=-6 \\\\ x_{3} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation, we get $x_3=4.$ Substituting this value into the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n1x_2+(-2)(4)=-6\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_2=2\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting these values into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\nx_1+(1)(2)+(3)(4)=14\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad x_1=0\n$$\n\nSo, the solution of the system is $x_1=0$, $x_2=2$, $x_3=4$, which means\n\n$$\n0a_1+(2)a_2+(4)a_3=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_{1} + x_{2} + x_{3}=(0)+(2)+(4)=6.\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0" :question/answer-fields "4841a2ba-e729-5d5a-9b30-9d8da775c96a"] [:db/ensure "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186119854 :knowledge-point/questions "cb3b6978-3983-5397-b56f-70c9f5f783c0"] [:db/add "a7aca1a3-1023-5681-8635-df7b109c61dd" :answer/id #uuid "a7aca1a3-1023-5681-8635-df7b109c61dd"] [:db/add "a7aca1a3-1023-5681-8635-df7b